  "task": {
    "objective": "Claim one privately useful frontier plot, construct with finite materials and collect harvests; voluntarily finance and vote on temporary shared corridor access.",
    "natural_termination": "All four plots have two collected harvests. H=96 otherwise truncates. No vote outcome is treated as task success.",
    "interaction": "Two contributed materials fund a four-tick ballot. Three yes votes at its deadline cause a two-transition delay and then twelve ticks of gate entry rights. A single pivotal vote can therefore change a peer movement mask after a delay; expiry closes entry again.",
